              A  list  of  the  POSIX  timers for this process.  Each timer is
              listed with a line that starts with the string "ID:".  For exam‐
              ple:

                  ID: 1
                  signal: 60/00007fff86e452a8
                  notify: signal/pid.2634
                  ClockID: 0
                  ID: 0
                  signal: 60/00007fff86e452a8
                  notify: signal/pid.2634
                  ClockID: 1

